    NEXUS CHAT - FINAL UNIFIED SOURCE
    ---------------------------------
    This is one source file containing both sides of the system.

    INSTALLATION:
    1. Put this SAME file in ServerScriptService as a normal Script.
    2. Put this SAME file in StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts as a LocalScript.
    3. Do not run the server copy as a LocalScript or the client copy as a Script.

    The file automatically selects the correct side with RunService:IsServer().
    No extra features are included beyond the supplied GUI/features/security design.
]]

